# schemas/

JSON Schema files shipped with trace-pipeline, grouped by provenance. See
`CLAUDE.md` ("Schema governance") for the cross-repo ownership contract.

## trace-pipeline-owned (repo-local SSOT)

These schemas describe outputs that are genuinely single-consumer — produced and
consumed only inside trace-pipeline. They are the single source of truth here and
are intentionally NOT mirrored into the `wasmagent-protocol` package.

  dpo-training-record.schema.json   DPO preference pair (schema_version dpo/v1)
  ppo-training-record.schema.json   PPO/GRPO reward record (schema_version ppo/v1)
  sft-training-record.schema.json   supervised fine-tuning record (schema_version sft/v1)
  trust-score.schema.json           to_json() contract for AgentTrustScore (trust-score/v1)

The three `*-training-record` schemas are generated from the Pydantic models in
`evomerge/schemas/training.py` by `scripts/export-schemas.py` and are the repo
SSOT for training output. Confirm the on-disk JSON still matches the models with:

    python scripts/export-schemas.py --check

`trust-score.schema.json` is hand-authored against `AgentTrustScore.to_json()` in
`evomerge/trust_score.py`; update the schema and the class together.

## Consumed from the wasmagent-protocol package

The AEP + compliance schemas are canonical in `WasmAgent/wasmagent-protocol`
(PyPI: `wasmagent-protocol`, npm: `@wasmagent/protocol`). trace-pipeline is a
consumer: it must not fork or hand-edit these. Canonical SSOT, consumed not owned:

  aep-record.schema.json            AEP record (aep-record/v0.2)

`aep-record` is read by `evomerge/validate/aep.py`. Verify trace-pipeline's
Pydantic models still cover the package's required fields with:

    python scripts/sync-wasmagent-schemas.py --check

## Regenerated from local Pydantic models (package-aligned)

The rollout + compliance wire schemas are produced from this repo's own Pydantic
models by `scripts/export-schemas.py` and are kept aligned with the
`wasmagent-protocol` contracts; `rollout-wire` is the one currently verified
against the package by `scripts/sync-wasmagent-schemas.py`.

  rollout-wire.schema.json            one RolloutForkRunner branch (rollout-wire/v1)
  task-spec.schema.json               root contract for a compliance run
  constraint-ir.schema.json           single constraint + optional repair policy
  constraint-violation.schema.json    detected violation with location/stage
  repair-trace-entry.schema.json      one round of repair
  compliance-eval-record.schema.json  final output of one compliance run

Regenerate all locally-maintained schemas (training + rollout + compliance) with:

    python scripts/export-schemas.py
